# grok-repo-template

## Modules

### src/
Core library. Add your package here.

### scripts/
- train.py — training entrypoint
- infer.py — inference / validation
- explore_dvc.py — DVC explore stage
- preprocess.py — data preprocessing
- colossus-launch.sh — cluster launch wrapper

### examples/
Domain-specific starters: vision, agents, fine-tuning, jax-colossus, rust-dojo, python-grok.

## Dependencies
See pyproject.toml. Optional: jax, torch.

## Usage
```bash
pip install -e .
python scripts/train.py --config configs/default.yaml
```
